sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Browser Client
    participant Server as Web / App Server
    participant SessionStore as Session Store (Redis / DB)

    Client->>Server: POST /auth/login (username, password)
    Server->>Server: Verify Credentials
    Server->>SessionStore: Store Session: sessionId="sess_abc123" -> { userId: 42, role: "admin" }
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Set-Cookie: sessionId=sess_abc123, HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax)

    Client->>Server: GET /dashboard (Cookie: sessionId=sess_abc123)
    Server->>SessionStore: Lookup "sess_abc123"
    SessionStore-->>Server: Return session data { userId: 42, role: "admin" }
    Server-->>Client: 200 OK (Rendered Dashboard)
